{"h": "1d05367d8e874b0e", "n": "This toroidal tank allows for many customizations with a hollow collision box. By adjusting the dimensions, the entire tank will adjust as well. It is comprised of many different tank types. You can choose the tank type below. Each tank type has a different base mass, different cost, and different amounts of utilization it can have. The HP versions of the tanks are Highly Pressurized and are used for engines that require it.", "s": "This toroidal tank allows for many customizations with a hollow collision box. By adjusting the dimensions, the entire tank will adjust as well. It is comprised of many different tank types. You can choose the tank type below. Each tank type has a different base mass, different cost, and different amounts of utilization it can have. The HP versions of the tanks are Highly Pressurized and are used for engines that require it.", "t": "该环形贮箱具有中空的碰撞箱并支持多种自定义设置。调整尺寸时，整个贮箱会成比例缩放。它包含多种不同的贮箱类型，可在下方选择。每种贮箱类型具有不同的基础质量、成本以及可用容积率。标记为 HP 的高压版本适用于需要增压输送的发动机。", "mod": "ROTanks"}
