{"h": "eb7f23f97e6d98c8", "n": "The Hollow Interstage allows you to change the Diameter of the part to fit many different configurations for your craft. It allows for customization of Decoupling just the bottom node as normal, or both nodes like a separator.", "s": "The Hollow Interstage allows you to change the Diameter of the part to fit many different configurations for your craft. It allows for customization of Decoupling just the bottom node as normal, or both nodes like a separator.", "t": "空心中级段允许你修改部件直径，以适配飞行器的多种不同构型。它支持自定义分离方式：既可按常规仅分离底部节点，也可像分离器一样同时分离两个节点。", "mod": "ROTanks"}
